From c583827a354674180dc8856eb65aeb3f0afa5ee9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thor Browser <engineering@thor.local>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Bind Thor privacy profiles to native content settings

Apply Stealth by default, expose explicit DevHost and Hardened modes through
Thor's owned-browser launch switch, deny high-entropy device APIs in target
profiles, and disable V8 JIT by default in Hardened. Unknown profile values
fail closed. Managed Chromium content-setting policy remains higher priority;
per-site exceptions remain available through Chromium's existing controls.
